    "experience_level": [
      "Group Level A - Workers who thanks to their professional knowledge and experience, coordinate, plan and manage the resources available to them, ensuring the achievement of the objectives pursued. They carry out these activities with autonomy and supervision. (probation period - 6 months)",
      "Group Level B - Workers who have assigned functions related to the analysis, definition, coordination and supervision of projects, tasks, sector-specific activities, line, area of belonging, ensuring the achievement of the objectives pursued, and who have the necessary training, knowledge and professional experience. They plan and manage the available human and technical resources by project. (probation period - 6 months)",
      "Group Level C - Workers who carry out technical activities within a certain area of knowledge and are responsible for planning and supervising the activities carried out by internal or external collaborators and who have the necessary training, knowledge and experience. They organize and plan the activities under their responsibility, being able to closely supervise the activity carried out by the people who make up their teams. (probation period is between 3- 6 months depending on Functional Area which will be reviewed during the Onboarding process)",
      "Group Level D - Workers carry out administrative and technical-operational processes, with an average level of complexity and who have the necessary training, knowledge and professional experience. You can supervise the activities of your dependents. They perform their functions with limited autonomy. (probation period is between 3- 6 months depending on Functional Area which will be reviewed during the Onboarding process)",
      "Group Level E - Workers who perform low-complexity technical and administrative tasks subject to work instructions, training, knowledge and professional experience. They perform their tasks without autonomy and under supervision. (probation period - 3 months)"
    ],
